# Gotchas & Guardrails

## Fixes when you touch these files

- `app/(tabs)/donate/give.tsx` — unused `campaignsLoading`, `error`
- `app/(tabs)/events.tsx` — unused `formatEventDate`

## Do not casually modify

`index.js` (import order), `metro.config.js` (SVG transformer), `firebase.ts`, `eas.json`, `app.json`, `android/app/build.gradle`, `android/gradle.properties`, `AndroidManifest.xml`.

## Common fixes

| Problem | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| `./gradlew clean` fails | `npm run clean` |
| Metro cache | `npx expo start -c` or delete `.expo/` |
| Native module mismatch | `npm run clean && npm install && npm start` |
| Functions timeout | Confirm `australia-southeast1` / `regionalFunctions` |

## Assets & nav

- Images: `assets/images/`; icons: Ionicons preferred; SVG via metro transformer
- Fonts: Poppins (`@expo-google-fonts/poppins`)
- Routing: Expo Router in `app/`; deep links `alansar://`; `router.push()` for params

## When in doubt

Match existing patterns → strict TS → lint early → test on device → keep simple → leave code better than found → ask if requirements are unclear.
